'''Sugar''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2015 Christmas Gun Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2015|2015 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended. 

== Appearance ==
It resembles a minigun with a Christmas appearance to it. It has three barrels that are thin red and white candy canes, with solid red barrel clamps around them. The largest barrel clamp has golden stars and small Christmas lights on it. The minigun’s rotor is solid red with gold stars on it, similarly to the barrel clamp, and its handle is black with red lines on it.

== Trivia  ==
*When salvaged in the crafting station, it provides 255 godly [[Shards|shards]].
*Its model derives from the limited Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/101078326/Candy-Cane-Launcher Candy Cane Launcher]. However, the model was slightly altered so that players could hold it like a regular gun.
*It partners with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife [[Candy]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Candy Set|Candy Set]].
*In its preview in a player's [[inventory]], this weapon was shown upside-down, but this was later fixed in the [[Season 1]] update.
*Sugar has different Leaderboard variants in [[Blue Sugar|Blue]], [[Bronze Sugar|Bronze]], [[Silver Sugar|Silver]], and [[Gold Sugar|Gold]] which were awarded as [[Unique Weapons|Unique]] [[:Category:Trophy Items|Trophy Items]] for getting on the [[Christmas Event 2018]] Leaderboard.
*Its mesh, published by [[didi1147]], can be found [https://www.roblox.com/library/2994231221/SugarGun here].

